WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:02.102
Welcome to Scripture Study.

00:00:02.102 --> 00:00:11.251
In a few short videos, I'll show you how to read, study, and listen to the Bible, and how to keep your prayers and sermon notes in one place.

00:00:11.251 --> 00:00:12.873
Let's begin with reading.

00:00:13.676 --> 00:00:17.112
To choose a book, tap the menu button in the top corner.

00:00:17.112 --> 00:00:20.609
Pick a book, and then tap the chapter you'd like to read.

00:00:21.413 --> 00:00:24.448
To turn the page, simply swipe left or right.

00:00:24.448 --> 00:00:27.685
The arrows at the bottom of the screen work too.

00:00:28.489 --> 00:00:31.143
Change the translation from the toolbar.

00:00:31.143 --> 00:00:42.889
The King James, World English, American Standard, and Berean Standard Bibles are built in, and others, like the Christian Standard Bible, are in the list when they're available.

00:00:43.697 --> 00:00:53.254
Tap the letters button at the bottom to make the text larger or smaller, to choose a light or dark page, or to read in paragraphs instead of verses.

00:00:54.056 --> 00:00:59.389
And when you switch to another tab and come back, the Bible opens right where you left off.
